          "text": "The terms are the \u201cpronic\u201d (or oblong) numbers, i.e. products of two consecutive integers:\n\n   1\u00b72 = 2,\u20032\u00b73 = 6,\u20033\u00b74 = 12,\u20034\u00b75 = 20,\u20035\u00b76 = 30, \u2026\n\nHence if you start counting at n=1 the nth term is\n\n   a\u2099 = n\u00b7(n + 1)\n\nor equivalently\n\n   a\u2099 = n\u00b2 + n."
